{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/in/reviews/id1888344964"}, "name":{"label":"emojahsi"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-02-07T08:54:55-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"172"}, "id":{"label":"13723682874"}, "title":{"label":"They do fake promotions for buying membership"}, "content":{"label":"This app is a complete waste of time. I came here after seeing heavy promotion on Reddit pushing a “3-day free trial.” That alone should’ve been a red flag.\n\nThe moment you sign up, you realize the truth: everything is flooded with ads, and almost nothing works without pushing you to pay. The “free trial” is basically a joke — it exists only to trap users into a subscription.\n\nThe marketing is extremely misleading. What’s advertised and what you actually get are two totally different things. Instead of value, you get constant interruptions, upsells, and frustration.\n\nFeels like a classic bait-and-switch model designed to milk users, not help them. Uninstalled and cancelled immediately. Avoid this app.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/in/review?id=6532588521&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
